WEBVTT

NOTE
This scene takes place at the Training Center at night following the formal ball. Squall and Quistis explore the jungle-like interior habitat containing dangerous monsters. The FMV shows dense vegetation, artificial lighting systems, and stone walkways winding through the overgrown environment. A T-Rexaur dinosaur may be glimpsed through the foliage. Alternatively, this scene may show Quistis and Squall walking along the Garden's outer walkway at night with starry sky and ocean visible below.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Stone archway entrance to the Training Center. Dense tropical vegetation fills the space — vines drape from overhead structures, exotic plants line the paths. Artificial lighting casts shadows across the jungle terrain.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Squall and Quistis walk along a stone pathway illuminated by overhead lights. Thick vegetation surrounds them on both sides. The air is humid and tropical. Shadows move across the stone floor as branches sway.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
A massive T-Rexaur dinosaur briefly appears through the foliage in the distance. Its scaled body is partially obscured by dense vegetation. The creature's silhouette towers above the surrounding plants. The path ahead curves deeper into the jungle habitat.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The camera pans across the Training Center's interior. Vertical rocky formations rise like natural columns. Waterfalls cascade down stone walls. Bioluminescent plants glow faintly in alcoves. The walkway continues into darkness ahead.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Night sky visible above the Garden's outer walkway. Stars glimmer overhead in a dark indigo sky. The vast ocean stretches beneath, calm and dark. Distant lights of the coastal landscape twinkle along the horizon.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Quistis and Squall stand silhouetted against the starlit ocean view. The ocean breeze moves their hair slightly. They gaze out across the water as the scene fades.
